tialized here (profile experimental-science, manuscript defect_cocycle.tex); claude-code capture hooks installed to project `.claude/settings.json`; added `**/*.c`,`**/*.h` to scan globs. Use installed `ailog` 0.1.0 (pipx, on PATH) — **lacks `prereg`/`graph`** (canonical repo f49bf3d has them; installed from 6f8a4ca). Pre-registrations logged via `ailog add`. Wrap builds/runs in `ailog run --`.\n\n**Critique-driven requirements baked in:** (1) Exp H mod-3^r congruence is a correctness GATE built first; (2) report rho_annealed and rho_exact as SEPARATE columns (never substitute annealed Fourier for exact operator); (3) shadow search flags limsup plateaus AND long sparse blocks, not just positive-density; (4) quenched pressure = limsup (1/n)Σ sΔ_b, not sum-over-words.\n\n**Progress: ALL 9 EXPERIMENTS BUILT & VALIDATED (M0–M4 done).** README.md + VALIDATION_REPORT.md written. Builds clean FAST128/GMP/DEBUG; `make test` passes.\n- **M0.** collatz_core/bigval (FAST128+GMP), orbit_scan, modarith, io_csv, config, main. Exp H GATE PASSES: 226128/226128 (seeds 3–9999, r≤8) + 144/144 GMP (seed 9999999999999999, r=12, deep n) → mod-3^r identity confirmed.\n- **M1.** entropy_stats, critical_events. (A) height tail slope ≈ −1. (B) boundary-excluded middle bulk leans to p^(1) (KL_to_p1<KL_to_annealed).\n- **M2.** characters (additive + mult-3^r), defect_sums (W via complex prefix), per-step residue capture, segment labeler. (C) |W|@s=0 decays with window len. (D) post-exit taboo: KL_to_p=0.18 ≪ KL_to_p1=0.57, M_post(1)≈0.99<1.\n- **M3.** sparse_matrix (CSR, power iteration), residue_height_graph (forward map Q odd, inverse branch Q⊥3, killed height band). (E) nontrivial sectors strictly below trivial; s=1 k=1 smallest gap 0.994. (F) exact gap DEVIATES from annealed |p̂| by ±0.1–0.36 (separate columns; finiteness leak real).\n- **M4.** Exp G (dense tr(L^n)+det(1-zL) via LU). Exp I (shadow-search): raw δ=0.1 saturates (short windows+max-over-grid) → added length-scaled null, require ≥3×. Then 4.8% flag; critical_C_A 8.3%>high_ascent 5.8%>post_exit 3.7%; shadow rate grows with len → 97.8% @len64+ (n=44, caveat). Single-orbit |W| noise-dominated short; clean signal is operator gap (E/F).\n\n**aipm:** 7 captures (pre-reg + per-milestone) + 1 run event; `ailog validate` passes. NOT git-committed (mynotes has many unrelated pending changes — leave commit to user).\n\n**OPEN — needs user decision:** the \"C_A-critical\" definition is project-internal (H23a/PVT/SRCE, carried over without restatement). The spec's literal `V^2 ≤ 2^A P` floods event counts (every excursion once the orbit descends to small record-low V). Added `--crit-mode {vsq|height}`; `height` (peak ≥ launch·2^A) is the cleaner \"high ascent\" reading. Both show the Cramér-tilt direction in the middle bulk. Affects Exp B/D and the critical/high_ascent segment labels in C/I — confirm the formal certificate before finalizing those. Related to [[project-aipm]] dogfooding (installed CLI missing prereg/graph).\n","replaceAll":false,"structuredPatch":[{"lines":[" - **M3.** sparse_matrix (CSR, power iteration), residue_height_graph (forward map Q odd, inverse branch Q⊥3, killed height band). (E) nontrivial sectors strictly below trivial; s=1 k=1 smallest gap 0.994. (F) exact gap DEVIATES from annealed |p̂| by ±0.1–0.36 (separate columns; finiteness leak real)."," - **M4.** Exp G (dense tr(L^n)+det(1-zL) via LU). Exp I (shadow-search): raw δ=0.1 saturates (short windows+max-over-grid) → added length-scaled null, require ≥3×. Then 4.8% flag; critical_C_A 8.3%>high_ascent 5.8%>post_exit 3.7%; shadow rate grows with len → 97.8% @len64+ (n=44, caveat). Single-orbit |W| noise-dominated short; clean signal is operator gap (E/F)."," ","-**aipm:** 7 captures (pre-reg + per-milestone) + 1 run event; `ailog validate` passes. NOT git-committed (mynotes has many unrelated pending changes — leave commit to user).","+**LARGE-SCALE RUN done** (out_large/, `run_large.sh`, FAST128 release; raw CSVs gitignore